00:16.193 --> 00:18.320
Absolutely.

00:19.296 --> 00:21.992
You're such an unexpected surprise
in my life, Alan.

00:22.165 --> 00:23.826
Thank you.

00:24.001 --> 00:27.767
- Uh, once again, I'm assuming that's good.
- Ha, ha. It's great.

00:29.606 --> 00:32.439
- Do you always wear your socks in bed?
- Oh, no.

00:32.609 --> 00:36.136
One of my toenails is kind of snaggly.
