we were going to make love...

00:40.217 --> 00:42.845
...I would've slapped a corn pad
on the little bugger.

00:44.621 --> 00:46.452
Mom!
- Damn it.

00:46.623 --> 00:49.319
Eldridge, why aren't you
with your dad?

00:49.493 --> 00:52.155
Because he's a giant douche.

00:52.329 --> 00:54.957
