Is it Dave?

01:11.014 --> 01:14.142
- No.
Jimmy?

01:14.318 --> 01:15.649
No.

01:16.253 --> 01:18.187
He's just trying to push my buttons.

01:18.388 --> 01:21.482
Yeah, Jake's exactly the same way,
always trying to get my goat.

01:21.658 --> 01:23.956
Now, who are Dave and Jimmy?

01:24.761 --> 01:28.219
Please don't tell me
you're doing Jake's loser dad.

01:29.533 --> 01:31.694
