01:31.868 --> 01:34.200
I can't be picky.

01:36.506 --> 01:38.838
Now, shut your pie hole.

01:39.009 --> 01:41.500
I hate you.
- I hate you right back.

01:43.313 --> 01:46.476
So where were we?

01:49.119 --> 01:52.680
Um, are you sure you don't wanna
spend some time with your son?

01:53.090 --> 01:54.284
I just did.

01:55.559 --> 01:57.117
Fair enough.

01:59.196 --> 02:01.255
Can you tell I got my boobs done?

02:02.132 --> 02:05.295
- Oh, no, they, uh, feel very natural.
- Oh, good.

02:05.902 --> 02:08.496
