on a quiet day.

02:16.413 --> 02:19.405
Oh, just, uh...
Just FYI, I'm all original equipment.

02:19.583 --> 02:20.607
Ah.

02:20.784 --> 02:23.218
Aside from, you know,
a little anal bleaching.

02:23.387 --> 02:24.752
What?

