05:07.818 --> 05:10.286
Hello? Hello? Ugh.

05:10.487 --> 05:13.285
Well, have a nice day,
you miserable bitch.

05:13.657 --> 05:16.956
Oh, you're still here?
Uh... Have a good weekend.

05:18.662 --> 05:23.258
You know, Zippy, you remind me
of a blind cat I used to have.

05:23.433 --> 05:26.197
