07:17.814 --> 07:20.806
You don't have to be responsible
for him. Just let him see you.

07:21.017 --> 07:23.212
You know,
the illusion of adult supervision.

07:23.787 --> 07:27.018
No, no, no. I got plans of my own.
If you're gonna go, take your kid with you.

07:27.223 --> 07:29.555
