Don't toy with my heart.

08:04.127 --> 08:05.958
All right, all right, tell you what.

08:06.129 --> 08:09.257
Go tell Jake to pack a bag.
I'll drop him off at his mom's.

08:09.432 --> 08:10.865
Now you're making sense.

08:14.838 --> 08:16.362
Sorry, sorry, sorry!

08:17.741 --> 08:21.700
