08:53.510 --> 08:57.469
Hey, hey, hey.
I don't burden you with my problems.

09:03.987 --> 09:07.388
Hey, Eldridge. My uncle's horny.
I'll meet you at the pier.

09:09.559 --> 09:10.924
This is fun, huh?

09:11.127 --> 09:14.654
