09:49.299 --> 09:51.859
No, actually,
I have to get some tampons.

09:52.902 --> 09:55.029
Oh. Oh, you mean for just in case, right?

09:55.672 --> 09:58.835
- Afraid not. Sorry.
- Oh, no, no, don't be silly.

09:59.008 --> 10:03.035
