11:55.358 --> 11:57.952
&lt;i>Could be the prom scene from Carrie.&lt;/i>

11:59.329 --> 12:02.059
That's not funny.
- Sorry.

12:02.232 --> 12:04.564
Uh, tell you what,
I will call for some room service.

12:04.734 --> 12:07.100
