19:39.922 --> 19:41.514
Whatever.

19:43.225 --> 19:47.559
I think we handled that really well.
Tough love, but I'm still the cool uncle.

19:48.197 --> 19:50.859
Hey, if you're happy, I'm happy.

19:51.033 --> 19:54.002
I'm very happy.
In fact, are you free tomorrow?

19:54.170 --> 19:56.730
