19:58.808 --> 20:02.403
How about you drag me to some boring
museum so I can miss the Laker game?

20:03.913 --> 20:07.007
It's your money.
Is it okay if I go take a shower?

20:07.183 --> 20:10.016
- Sure. I'll be up in a bit.
- Okay.

20:16.459 --> 20:19.189
Still cheaper than getting married.

20:25.301 --> 20:28.327
Alrighty, here we are.

20:28.504 --> 20:30.938
- Thank you.
- You're welcome.

20:32.341 --> 20:35.401
Believe it or not,
I actually had a good time.

20:35.611 --> 20:37.511
- Really?
- Well, yeah.

20:37.680 --> 20:41.013
Nice hotel, room service, no teenagers.

20:41.617 --> 20:43.209
I'm glad.

20:43.385 --> 20:46.149
So shall we try it again?

20:46.322 --> 20:49.519
In, you know, five or six days?

20:51.026 --> 20:52.323
I would like that.

20:56.132 --> 20:57.724
Okay, uh, I don't mean to rush you...

20:57.900 --> 21:00.198
...but I really have to go home
to my bathroom.

21:00.369 --> 21:01.427
Wanna use mine?

21:01.637 --> 21:05.004
Uh, no, no, that wouldn't be good
for our relationship.

21:05.174 --> 21:08.905
- All right. Well, bye.
- Seriously, get out of the car.

21:18.354 --> 21:20.219
&lt;i>Oklahoma, where the wind...&lt;/i>
